    (descr "Kailh Choc V1 key switch (PG1350, e.g. CPG135001D02) in a Kailh hotswap socket CPG135001S30 (JLCPCB C5333465) soldered on the back. Switch pin holes 3.05 mm at (0,-5.9) and (5,-3.8), socket lands 2.55 x 2.5 mm at (-3.5,-6) and (8.5,-3.8) on B.Cu, centre post 3.45 mm, guide posts 1.9 mm at +/-5.5 mm: kiswitch SW_Hotswap_Kailh_Choc_V1 and urchin agree. The switch is pressed in at case assembly; the case front holds it as the plate (13.8 mm cut-out). Dwgs.User: 18 x 15.2 mm cap.")
